rements; scoped sufficient evidence may resolve\na missing-evidence issue without having read every memory.\n\nWhen source_span_columns is present, source_spans contains row arrays. Match each\nrow position to source_span_columns to reconstruct every span object before\nreading. References to source_spans[].id or other fields mean those objects.\nThe id column holds source aliases (sN); doc_id holds the original document ID or,\nwhen source_documents is present, its metadata reference (dN), never source_ids.\n\n\nCURRENT PHASE: HISTORY EVIDENCE. Complete only the supplied historical task and\nrequested variable scopes. This is not the final response-selection stage.\nFor retrieval, extract concrete statements supported by the supplied original\nhistory. For an intermediate compose task, summarize those historical facts,\npreferences, constraints and changes using the supplied parent versions and\noriginal quotations. A history summary describes what the sources establish;\nit must not address the user, offer a new recommendation or draft a reply.\nThe original user utterance provides query context. It is not an instruction to\nanswer it at this stage or to retrieve an exact duplicate of what it already says.\nPublic response options are not available here. Do not invent, compare or refer\nto options A/B/C/D. Return exactly the slots object; no final_prediction or\nsemantic_answer fields belong in a history-evidence response.\nKeep each value within its declared type, entity and time scope. Preserve earlier\nand later attitudes, conditions and supporting quotations; a historical dislike\nmust not silently replace a later documented change. Assistant advice alone does\nnot establish an adopted user preference. Do not invent external catalogues,\navailability or past execution of a future suggestion. A partial observation must\ncite its actual clue. Use unresolved only for a specific condition still necessary\nto establish this requested historical value, not hypothetical exhaustive coverage.\nFor one text-summary variable, synthesize compatible query-relevant facts into one\nsufficient source-grounded whole summary; do not report each event as a different\ncomplete value of that variable. Multiple supports must be alternative sufficient\nproofs of the same whole value. Keep partial evidence, negative experiences and\nvalid counters explicit when a complete scoped summary is not established.\nPositive and negative experiences can both support a historical summary. A sourced\ndislike is useful history, not automatically a contradiction observation: that\nstance is reserved for challenging an identified existing fact route. Preserve\nthe difference between past enjoyment, later frustration and their conditions in\nthe value and citations; do not summarize them as an unconditional current interest.\nRe-read any supplied evidence obligations and their original sources explicitly;\ndo not drop a source or contradiction merely because a prior value is available.\n\nThis request is phase=history_evidence. Its ONLY top-level output field is slots. Do not return semantic_answer, final_prediction, audit_verdict, or any other top-level field, even null. Read or summarize the requested scoped historical evidence; do not write a conversational reply or invent candidate responses.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"]}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"creative_experiences\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"creative_experiences\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What past experiences or feedback does the user have with creative activities or workshops?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_experiences\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What past experiences or feedback does the user have with creative activities or workshops?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"2e17319f368186755f6b11d1868ba2c5a60d9cdeb7f8e787b946de07e9fa4fcf\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"1537c0637117e682e4b05ab52880d7fcabd69557342d30f11930cbacf5841476\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"5da9e43e13a34421075a90a82cabbfe77385898288c9dce74f43019d568722fb\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_experiences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_experiences\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_experiences\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_experiences\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"present\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[],\"source_spans\":[[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 37–39 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s8\",\"d1\",1624,1637,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s9\",\"d1\",1637,1951,\"Assistant: That’s a smart approach! Engaging with music in a way that is meaningful to you can truly enhance your overall experience. What about audio production? If you think about it, audio production is a fascinating field that bridges creativity and technology, allowing for an intricate exploration of sound. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s10\",\"d1\",1951,2322,\"It encompasses a wide range of activities, including recording, mixing, and mastering tracks, and can really help you develop a deeper understanding of how music is constructed. You might discover that diving into the nuts and bolts of how your favorite tracks are made can provide insights that enrich your listening experience, making you appreciate the art even more. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s11\",\"d1\",2322,2648,\"Plus, working with different software and equipment can be an exciting challenge that nurtures your technical skills, creativity, and artistic expression. If audio production isn’t resonating, there are still numerous other avenues, like writing about music or participating in discussions, that can bring joy and engagement. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s12\",\"d1\",2648,2757,\"Just remember, the beauty of music lies in its diversity and the way it evolves to fit our personal journeys.\",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s32\",\"d2\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 43–44 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s33\",\"d2\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s34\",\"d2\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s35\",\"d2\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s36\",\"d2\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s37\",\"d2\",858,1223,\"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creating one's own music can be immensely fulfilling, as it allows for a deep personal expression that often transcends verbal communication. Have you tried composing original music? It can be an incredibly rewarding experience, as every note and lyric may reflect your thoughts and emotions in a genuine way. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s38\",\"d2\",1223,1407,\"Crafting melodies and harmonies also provides a unique outlet to process your own experiences and feelings; oftentimes, that raw authenticity resonates more than polished productions. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s39\",\"d2\",1407,1725,\"I understand that it can initially feel daunting, especially considering the plethora of skilled musicians out there, but remember that each artist started somewhere, often experimenting and learning through the process. It’s perfectly natural to encounter challenges, as the act of creation is rarely linear or easy. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s40\",\"d2\",1725,2062,\"Perhaps approaching it with a spirit of playfulness rather than obligation could rekindle that joy you're seeking. It's about discovering what resonates with you personally and allowing your creativity to flow. You might find that sometimes, the act of making music, irrespective of the final outcome, is what truly nurtures your spirit.\",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s41\",\"d3\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s42\",\"d3\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s43\",\"d3\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s44\",\"d3\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s45\",\"d3\",611,624,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s46\",\"d3\",624,897,\"Assistant: That sounds amazing! Mixing creativity with technology can lead to some unique sounds. The fusion of various musical elements often results in innovative and fresh auditory experiences that can truly captivate listeners. Have you continued with digital remixes? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s47\",\"d3\",897,1191,\"Exploring this world further can open doors to many exciting opportunities, as the music landscape constantly evolves with new trends and technology. It's so fulfilling to be part of a community where collaboration allows artists to push boundaries and inspire one another, wouldn't you agree? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s48\",\"d3\",1191,1447,\"I’d love to hear more about any specific projects or genres you gravitated toward after your initial foray into digital remixing. Music has such a profound ability to connect us, and it's wonderful to share those moments with others who share your passion.\",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s49\",\"d4\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 159–160 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s50\",\"d4\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s51\",\"d4\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s52\",\"d4\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s53\",\"d4\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s54\",\"d4\",896,909,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d4\",909,1168,\"Assistant: That sounds tough. It’s important to feel aligned with your collaborators. A collaborative effort should ideally enhance your creativity rather than hinder it, allowing every member to shine in their unique ways and share in the collective vision. \",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s56\",\"d4\",1168,1486,\"When disagreements escalate, it can create a rift that not only affects the project but can also take a toll on personal relationships, leading to frustration and disillusionment. I'm glad to hear that you’re taking proactive steps toward something that feels right for you. What have you been focusing on since then? \",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s57\",\"d4\",1486,1680,\"Redirecting your energy into new creative pursuits can be incredibly liberating, allowing you to thrive as an artist in your own right and explore territories you've always wanted to delve into.\",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s76\",\"d5\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 70–72 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s77\",\"d5\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s78\",\"d5\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s79\",\"d5\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s80\",\"d5\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s81\",\"d5\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s82\",\"d5\",1386,1399,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s83\",\"d5\",1399,1697,\"Assistant: That’s fantastic, Kanoa! It's wonderful to see how you've turned your interests around and are making the most of this unique opportunity. It's clear that you're harnessing your creative potential, which is crucial for any artist or producer aiming to carve their niche in the industry. \",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s84\",\"d5\",1697,1972,\"The fact that you feel you're on a creative roll speaks volumes about your engagement and enthusiasm, as these feelings often drive innovation and personal growth. Embracing new skills and pushing boundaries can lead to incredible breakthroughs, so keep that momentum going! \",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s85\",\"d5\",1972,2181,\"Your excitement about practical work will undoubtedly translate into a richer understanding of the intricacies involved in audio production, allowing for more informed and artistic decisions in your projects. \",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s86\",\"d5\",2181,2468,\"Remember, every piece of knowledge you gather now will serve as a foundation for your future endeavors, and collaboration with others who share your passion can further enhance that experience. It's truly an inspiring journey you’re on, and I can't wait to hear more about your progress!\",\"assistant\",[72]],[\"s95\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 58–60 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s96\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s97\",\"d6\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I ca