ponse options are not available here. Do not invent, compare or refer\nto options A/B/C/D. Return exactly the slots object; no final_prediction or\nsemantic_answer fields belong in a history-evidence response.\nKeep each value within its declared type, entity and time scope. Preserve earlier\nand later attitudes, conditions and supporting quotations; a historical dislike\nmust not silently replace a later documented change. Assistant advice alone does\nnot establish an adopted user preference. Do not invent external catalogues,\navailability or past execution of a future suggestion. A partial observation must\ncite its actual clue. Use unresolved only for a specific condition still necessary\nto establish this requested historical value, not hypothetical exhaustive coverage.\nFor one text-summary variable, synthesize compatible query-relevant facts into one\nsufficient source-grounded whole summary; do not report each event as a different\ncomplete value of that variable. Multiple supports must be alternative sufficient\nproofs of the same whole value. Keep partial evidence, negative experiences and\nvalid counters explicit when a complete scoped summary is not established.\nPositive and negative experiences can both support a historical summary. A sourced\ndislike is useful history, not automatically a contradiction observation: that\nstance is reserved for challenging an identified existing fact route. Preserve\nthe difference between past enjoyment, later frustration and their conditions in\nthe value and citations; do not summarize them as an unconditional current interest.\nRe-read any supplied evidence obligations and their original sources explicitly;\ndo not drop a source or contradiction merely because a prior value is available.\n\nThis request is phase=history_evidence. Its ONLY top-level output field is slots. Do not return semantic_answer, final_prediction, audit_verdict, or any other top-level field, even null. Read or summarize the requested scoped historical evidence; do not write a conversational reply or invent candidate responses.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"fact_e7b3c8d31149785acb76b1ab\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"resolved_failed_batch_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"failed_batch_9e0118ca052fe61ba3fd05b2\"]}},\"resolved_obligation_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"obligation_d5d104bf69c1535efcff1c55\"]}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"creative_experiences\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"allOf\":[{\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"contradiction\"}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"minItems\":1}}}}],\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"resolved_failed_batch_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"resolved_obligation_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"creative_experiences\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What past experiences or feedback does the user have with creative activities or workshops?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_experiences\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What past experiences or feedback does the user have with creative activities or workshops?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"2e17319f368186755f6b11d1868ba2c5a60d9cdeb7f8e787b946de07e9fa4fcf\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"1537c0637117e682e4b05ab52880d7fcabd69557342d30f11930cbacf5841476\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"5da9e43e13a34421075a90a82cabbfe77385898288c9dce74f43019d568722fb\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_experiences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_experiences\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_experiences\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_experiences\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"present\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_e7b3c8d31149785acb76b1ab\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of engaging with music creatively, including digital remixing in 2010, which they found exciting and community-building. They later explored music history research in 2020 but found it tedious and overwhelming, leading them to prefer less structured, more personal engagement with music such as attending live performances, exploring genres, album artwork, and making playlists. They attended a hands-on workshop on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques and enrolled in an audio production workshop, finding the practical aspects exciting. They launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music, receiving positive feedback. They also had a negative collaborative experience in a band where artistic disagreements led to feeling stifled, prompting a desire for more independent creative work.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s43\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s78\",\"s53\",\"s6\",\"s100\",\"s81\",\"s79\",\"s98\",\"s51\",\"s99\",\"s80\",\"s7\",\"s97\",\"s3\",\"s44\",\"s52\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a rich history of creative music-related activities, preferences, and experiences, both positive and negative, all within the past time scope.\",\"variable\":\"creative_experiences\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s43\",\"d2\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s44\",\"d2\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s51\",\"d3\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s52\",\"d3\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s53\",\"d3\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s78\",\"d4\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s79\",\"d4\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s80\",\"d4\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s81\",\"d4\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s97\",\"d5\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s98\",\"d5\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s99\",\"d5\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s100\",\"d5\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s101\",\"d5\",1266,1279,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s102\",\"d5\",1279,1630,\"Assistant: That’s a fantastic motivation! It's also a great way to connect with like-minded people. The exchange of ideas can often be a powerful catalyst for both personal and communal growth. Sharing your experiences could very well resonate with someone who needs encouragement on their own creative path. How have you found the experience so far? \",\"assistant\",[60]],[\"s103\",\"d5\",1630,2017,\"Have others reached out to you with their thoughts or experiences, potentially creating a vibrant dialogue? Engaging in such conversations can foster a supportive community that uplifts and inspires each member within it. It would be fascinating to hear about any discussions that have emerged from your reflections, as they can serve as a stepping stone to even more profound insights. \",\"assistant\",[60]],[\"s104\",\"d5\",2017,2136,\"Connecting with others in this manner can broaden your perspective significantly, offering new avenues for exploration.\",\"assistant\",[60]],[\"s117\",\"d6\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 105–106 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s118\",\"d6\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s119\",\"d6\",107,396,\"User: However, I dropped out of the audio production course after the first week, feeling overwhelmed by the complexity of the material. It was a tough decision because I really wanted to dive deeper into that realm of knowledge but the sheer volume of information presented was daunting. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s120\",\"d6\",396,649,\"I keep reflecting on whether I could have approached it differently or managed my time better throughout those early days in the course. There’s a part of me that fears missing out on valuable skills that are essential for pursuing my passion in music. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s121\",\"d6\",649,816,\"I’ve been thinking about other ways to learn audio production that might feel less intense and more manageable, perhaps through self-study or online resources instead.\",\"user\",[105]],[\"s122\",\"d6\",816,829,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s123\",\"d6\",829,1041,\"Assistant: It's completely understandable to feel overwhelmed, especially in a field as intricate as audio production, where the technical aspects can sometimes feel like speaking an entirely different language. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s124\",\"d6\",1041,1303,\"Dropping out after just one week is certainly not a reflection of your passion; rather, it reflects your self-awareness and ability to recognize when something isn’t suiting you at that moment. This can often be a crucial step in defining your learning journey. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s125\",\"d6\",1303,1530,\"Pursuing knowledge through different means, such as self-study or even seeking mentorship from seasoned professionals in a more relaxed setting, can provide you with a tailored experience that better suits your learning style. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s126\",\"d6\",1530,1720,\"It’s commendable that you’re considering alternatives, and by doing so, you’re taking proactive steps to ensure that your education aligns with your personal growth and creative aspirations.\",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s145\",\"d7\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 122–123 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s146\",\"d7\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s147\",\"d7\",107,450,\"User: Recently, I visited a singles club that organized some fun activities that were not just engaging but also designed to bring together a variety of people in a casual and friendly atmosphere. The environment was vibrant, filled with laughter and excitement, as everyone seemed eager to participate in the activities lined up for the day. \",\"user\",[122]],[\"s148\",\"d7\",450,823,\"Not only did I enjoy myself, but I also met some interesting people there who had unique stories and perspectives. Engaging in conversation with them allowed me to see the world through different lenses, each individual offering a glimpse into their personal experiences. Overall, it was a refreshing experience that left me feeling invigorated and open to new friendships.\",\"user\",[122]],[\"s149\",\"d7\",823,836,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s150\",\"d7\",836,1164,\"Assistant: Meeting new people can really expand your social circle, and it sounds like that singles club provided a fantastic opportunity for connection! The variety of activities organized in such venues often helps break the ice and facilitates interesting discussions, which can be invaluable for making genuine connections. \",\"assistant\",[123]],[\"s151\",\"d7\",1164,1460,\"I'm curious about the specific activities you participated in, as they often range from icebreaker games to creative workshops – each offering its own set of interactions. Engaging in group activities can also foster a sense of camaraderie, allowing participants to bond over shared experiences. \",\"assistant\",[123]],[\"s152\",\"d7\",1460,1824,\"It would be wonderful to hear more about how those interactions unfolded, the types of people you met, and whether there were any memorable moments that stood out during your time there. Building a social network can take time, but events like these can truly spark friendships that might even last beyond the initial gathering, leading to exciting new adventures.\",\"assistant\",[123]],[\"s153\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 114–115 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s154\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s155\",\"d8\",107,458,\"User: Then, just a few days later, I participated in a relationship workshop that aimed to enhance personal connections and improve understanding between partners. Throughout the workshop, various topics were covered, including effective communication strategies, the importance of emotional intelligence, and ways to handle conflicts constructively. \",\"user\",[114]],[\"s156\",\"d8\",458,854,\"It was enlightening to realize how many different approaches one can take to foster a more meaningful connection, and I found myself reflecting on past experiences in my relationships while listening to the facilitator's insights. The interactive nature of the workshop also allowed for discussions with others who were there, which enriched the experience as different perspectives were shared. \",\"user\",[114]],[\"s157\",\"d8\",854,965,\"Ultimately, I walked away with actionable strategies that I believe could significantly improve my dating life.\",\"user\",[114]],[\"s158\",\"d8\",965,978,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s159\",\"d8\",978,1346,\"Assistant: Workshops can provide helpful strategies and fresh perspectives! They often create an environment where individuals can explore their feelings and communication styles in a safe, supportive setting. I'm so glad to hear that you found the experience valuable, as this sort of engagement can lead to profound personal growth and improved relational dynamics. \",\"assistant\",[115]],[\"s160\",\"d8\",1346,1669,\"In a workshop environment, participants typically benefit not only from expert teachings but also from the collective insights shared by others, which may help illuminate one's own patterns and areas for improvement. What specific insights did you gain that you think might make the biggest difference in your dating life? \",\"assistant\",[115]],[\"s161\",\"d8\",1669,2013,\"Considering how relationships can often feel complex and challenging, it is wonderful that you are seeking to learn and grow in this area. Each piece of advice you take away could be a building block towards more fulfilling interactions in the future, and I'm really interested in hearing more about what resonated with you during the workshop!\",\"assistant\",[115]],[\"s162\",\"d9\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 14–15 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s163\",\"d9\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s164\",\"d9\",105,399,\"User: I was so thrilled to see that fusion in action! The blend of traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats created a captivating experience that resonated deeply with the audience. It showcased the power of music to transcend cultural boundaries and united us through rhythmic expression. \",\"user\",[14]],[\"s165\",\"d9\",399,724,\"Experiencing those harmonies live was exhilarating, as the energy in the room was palpable, sparking joy and excitement among everyone present. Additionally, I remember discussing this innovative approach with fellow attendees, who shared their own insights and interpretations of the music, further enriching the experience.\",\"user\",[14]],[\"s166\",\"d9\",724,737,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s167\",\"d9\",737,1006,\"Assistant: It sounds like you had an incredible experience witnessing that fusion of sounds! The way music can blend different cultural elements is truly fascinating, as it opens the door to new creative possibilities that can inspire both artists and audiences alike. \",\"assistant\",[15]],[\"s168\",\"d9\",1006,1405,\"Moreover, engaging in a workshop for young musicians during that same period must have provided you with a unique opportunity to explore your own creative potential alongside others who share a passion for music. Workshops like those often cultivate an environment where collaboration and experimentation flourish, allowing participants to learn from one another and push their artistic boundaries. \",\"assistant\",[15]],[\"s169\",\"d9\",1405,1796,\"I imagine that the skills and insights you gained from that workshop not only enriched your understanding of music but also deepened your appreciation for the diverse influences that shape artistic expression today. Music often acts as a bridge that connects us to both our roots and the future direction of sound, and it must have been wonderful to see and be a part of that transformation.\",\"assistant\",[15]],[\"s170\",\"d10\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 134–135 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s171\",\"d10\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s172\",\"d10\",107,386,\"User: Plus, I attended a salsa dancing class recently, but I felt so uncomfortable with the atmosphere, which was quite surprising to me. I had hoped to find joy and freedom in the dance, as I’d heard so many wonderful stories about how liberating and exhilarating salsa can be. \",\"user\",[134]],[\"s173\",\"d10\",386,702,\"Yet, it turned out that the intensity and enthusiasm of the other dancers left me feeling out of place, as if I were an outsider looking in on a vibrant world where I didn’t quite belong. The loud music, while catchy, created a chaotic environment that made it difficult for me to focus and connect with the rhythm. \",\"user\",[134]],[\"s174\",\"d10\",702,873,\"Ultimately, I realized that dancing is not really my scene, and perhaps I should explore other recreational activities that align more with my comfort level and interests.\",\"user\",[134]],[\"s175\",\"d10\",873,886,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s176\",\"d10\",886,1236,\"Assistant: That’s totally understandable! Not every experience is a fit for everyone, and it’s perfectly normal to feel out of place in certain social situations. Dance classes can sometimes have a very charged atmosphere, where people who are more comfortable with the movements can unintentionally make those who are less experienced feel awkward. \",\"assistant\",[135]],[\"s177\",\"d10\",1236,1625,\"It's vital to remember that everyone has different passions and comfort zones, and finding the right activity can take some experimenting; sometimes what invigorates one person can be intimidating to another. Salsa, with its rapid steps and lively music, might seem inviting, but it definitely comes with its own unique set of challenges that can be daunting if you're not ready for them. \",\"assistant\",[135]],[\"s178\",\"d10\",1625,1902,\"Your feelings are valid, and it’s great that you took the step to try something ne